<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction two bln SKR in five-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction two bln SKR in five-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office invited bids on Wednesday for an auction of two billion crowns of five-year bonds.</p>
<p>Bids have to be entered by 1130 GMT on March 26.</p>
<p>					     Loan 1039</p>
<p> Auction date			    March 26</p>
<p> Maturity date			   April 12, 2002</p>
<p> Coupon  (pct)			   5.50</p>
<p> Amount to the market (billions)   2.0</p>
<p> Settlement date			 April 2</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
